WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[No sound] The Revocalize hero: a ribbon of violet and blue light leans toward the pointer under "Your voice, revocalized."

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
Hear a voice: a phrase sung in the browser plays, and the ribbon pulses with it in cool blues.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
Revocalized: the voice moves up an octave with a harmony, and the ribbon turns orange, red and pink.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.500
Scrolling down, the hero fades and the ribbon narrows to a single line of light.

00:10.500 --> 00:15.080
"One voice in, any voice out.": the Generate Audio panel ticks through its settings and the revocalized take rises in colour.
